["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">状</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>状态；情形；状况；形式；外观</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">現状</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げんじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">现状；现有状态；既有状态</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">状況</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">事态；局面；情况；状况</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">症状</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">症状；病情</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">球</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>球；球体</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">球</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">球体；球；灯泡；（数学）球；球体；（棒球等的）投球数</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地球</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地球</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">電球</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">でんきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灯泡；电灯泡</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">職</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>职务；工作；职业</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショク・ソク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">職</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工作；职业；职位；职务；职责；职分；手艺；技能</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">就職</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうしょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">就业；就职；找到工作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">職業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょくぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">职业；工作；行业；营生；行当</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">与</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>给予；参与；共同；授予；提供</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あた.える・あずか.る・くみ.する・ともに</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">与える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あたえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">给予；授予；赐予；提供；赋予；供给；分配；指派；引起；造成；招致；传递（参数给函数）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">給与</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうよ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">薪酬；薪资；工资；报酬；津贴；补助；供给；供应</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">関与</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんよ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">参与；参加；涉及</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">供</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>供奉；提供；陪同；随从；口供</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ・ク・クウ・グ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そな.える・とも・-ども</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">子供</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こども</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孩子；儿童</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">供給</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">供给</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お供</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おとも</span><span class=\"k-wz\">随从；陪同者；伴随者</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">可</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>可以；许可；及格；可行</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ・コク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">-べ.き・-べ.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">可</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">か</span><span class=\"k-wz\">可以；尚可；允许；许可；赞成；同意；赞成票；赞成的一票；及格；尚可；C等；D等</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">可能</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かのう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">可能的；潜在的；可行的；可实现的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">許可</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">许可；批准；授权；执照</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">役</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>任务；职务；角色；兵役；劳役</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヤク・エキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">役に立つ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やくにたつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">有用；有帮助；派得上用场</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">役</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">战争；战役；战斗；无偿劳役；强制劳动</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">役割</span><span class=\"ka