t><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.ける・-つ.ける・-づ.ける・つ.け・つ.け-・-つ.け・-づ.け・-づけ・つ.く・-づ.く・つ.き・-つ.き・-つき・-づ.き・-づき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">受付</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うけつけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">接待处；前台；接待员；咨询员；受理；接收</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">付く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">附着；粘上；贴住；黏附；留下痕迹；留疤；着色；染色；结出（果实）；产生（利息）；习得；获得；增强；扎根；生根；陪同；随行；跟随；师从；站在…一边；属于；附身；缠绕；着火；点着；（灯）亮起；（电器）开着；敲定；解决；决定；被起名；被定价；被感知；被察觉；走运；幸运；变成；成为</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">片付ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたづける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">整理；收拾；清理；放好；解决；处理；处置；完成；做好；办完；给（女儿）找到婆家；嫁出（女儿）；杀死；除掉；消灭</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">由</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>理由；原因；缘故；由来；依据</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユ・ユウ・ユイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よし・よ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自由</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自由；自主</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">理由</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">理由</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">経由</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいゆ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">经由；途经；经过</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">説</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>意见；理论；说明；谣言</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セツ・ゼイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</s