\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">収入</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうにゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">收入；所得；收益；进款</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">断</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>切断；拒绝；决定；禁止；道歉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.つ・ことわ.る・さだ.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横断</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">横穿；穿过；横贯；相交；横断；横越；横渡；飞越；航越；横截；横切；横向切断</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">断る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ことわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拒绝</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">判断</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">判断</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">石</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>石头；宝石；岩石；矿石；石制</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セキ・シャク・コク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">石</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">石头；岩石；卵石；宝石；珠宝；打火石；棋子；围棋子；黑白棋子；结石；（膀胱、肾脏等的）结石</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">石炭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せきたん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">煤炭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">石油</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せきゆ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">石油；原油；（口语）煤油；火油</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">違</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>差异；不同；不一致；违背；弄错</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ちが.う・ちが.い・ちが.える・-ちが.える・たが.う・たが.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">違う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちがう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不同；有区别；有差异；不一致；错误；不对；搞错了；异常；出问题；不是吗；不对吗</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">間違える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まちがえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">犯错；出错；弄错；做错；搞混；误认；混淆</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">違反</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">违反；违背；违规；违犯；侵犯；违抗</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">消</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>熄灭；消失；消除；取消；消费</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">き.える・け.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">消す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">擦掉；划掉；删除；关闭；熄灭（灯、电视、暖气等）；扑灭；吹灭（火焰、蜡烛等）；除去；消除；解除（气味、疼痛等）；中和（毒素）；淹没；减弱；吸收；压低（声音）；杀死；谋杀；除掉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">消える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">消失；消散；不见；消失无踪；熄灭；（灯火等）灭掉；（电视屏幕等）关闭；（感情、印象等）褪去；消散；（如希望）消失；（气味、痒感、睡意等）消散；消失；（脚步声等）淡去；（铭文等）磨损；磨灭；（文字）擦去；（墨迹等）褪色；（传统等）失传；消亡；消失</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">消しゴム</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けしゴム</span><span class=\"k-wz\">橡皮擦；橡皮</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">神</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level