\" lang=\"ja\">たずねる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拜访；造访；登门</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">訪問</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほうもん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拜访；访问</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">訪れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おとずれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">访问；拜访；到来；降临；出现</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">乗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>乘坐；骑；乘；乘法；辆</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョウ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">の.る・-の.り・の.せる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乗る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">乘坐；登上；上车；上船；上飞机；登上；踏上；踩上；骑上；到达；越过；超过；跟随；保持；与…保持一致；跟上；参加；参与；加入；沉浸其中；全身心投入；兴致高涨；上当；受骗；被欺骗；被携带；传播；散开；传开；粘附；贴住；粘上；附上</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乗り物</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のりもの</span><span class=\"k-wz\">车辆；交通工具；运输工具；游乐设施；游乐项目</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乗り換える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のりかえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">换乘；转乘（火车、公交等）；改变；转换；转向（思想、党派、公司等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">想</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>思考；想法；认为；想象；打算</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ・ソ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おも.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">思想</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">思想；理念；意识形态</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">想像</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">想象；推测；猜测</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">理想</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">理想</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">声</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>声音；语音；声响</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こえ・こわ-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">声</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">声音；嗓音；鸟鸣；虫鸣；叫声；意见；呼声；观点；愿望；态度；意志；声音；预感；感觉；浊音</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">歓声</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">欢呼声；欢声；喝彩声</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">声明</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいめい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">声明；宣言；公告</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">助</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>帮助；救助；辅助</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たす.ける・たす.かる・す.ける・すけ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">援助</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">援助；帮助；支持</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">救助</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">救济；救援；救助</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">助手</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょしゅ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">助手；助理；（教授的）助手；研究助手</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">労</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>劳动；疲劳；犒劳；感谢；辛苦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ろう.する・いたわ.る・いた.ずき・ねぎら・つか.れる・ねぎら.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦労</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くろう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劳苦；辛苦；困难；辛劳；忧虑；担心；焦虑；挂虑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">労働</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劳动；劳力；工作；工党</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">労る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いたわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怜悯；同情；体谅；安慰；善待；体贴；照顾；护理；看护；安抚；慰劳；犒劳；酬劳（他人的辛劳）；认可（他人的努力）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">例</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>例子；习惯；用法；先例</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たと.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">例えば</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たとえば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">例如；比如；譬如</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">例</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ためし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">先例；例子</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">実例</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じつれい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">实例；例证；先例</span></li></ul></div></li>"]